    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop of misery. it's like there's no light at the end of this, and honestly, the thought of having to do this for another twenty or thirty years... it just sounds unbearable. i just want the pain to stop. i just want to be where he is.",
